   "options": "<br><h4>Note</h4><ul><li>You can use <a href=\"https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/en/2.11.x/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja tags</a> in <b>Subject</b> and <b>Body</b> fields for dynamic values.</li><li>Available objects: <b>doc</b> (trigger document), <b>notification</b> (this notification), <b>customer</b> (customer object), <b>reference_doc</b> (trigger document), <b>payment_entry</b> (payment entry if used), <b>sales_invoice</b> (sales invoice if used), <b>invoices</b> (list of invoices attached)</li></ul><h4>Examples</h4><ul><li><b>Subject</b>:<br><pre>Payment Receipt for {{ customer.customer_name }}</pre></li><li><b>Body</b>:<br><pre>Dear {{ customer.customer_name }},<br><br>Thank you for your payment. Please find attached your invoice(s) and account statement.<br><br>Payment Reference: {{ payment_entry.name }}<br>Amount: {{ payment_entry.paid_amount }}</pre></li></ul>"
